  (descr "Fanstel BM832A BLE module (Nordic nRF52810), 10.2x15.0x1.9mm, 47 LGA pads 0.4x0.4mm. Origin = bottom-left corner of module (pin 16 corner); pad coordinates from datasheet Ver 1.04 p.7 table. Antenna keepout (datasheet Ver 1.04 p.11): antenna area is the module top edge (pin 1 side, footprint Y 0..5.55). For best BT range the antenna area must extend 4.4 mm beyond the edge of the host PCB ground plane (or beyond the host PCB edge); no ground plane under the antenna; keep external metal >=30 mm from antenna area.")
